        "subject": "LU-19684 tests: skip conf-sanity/81 for old clients",
        "message": "LU-19684 tests: skip conf-sanity/81 for old clients\n\nSome formerly-valid OST index numbers were reserved for overstriping,\nand are now considered invalid.  The OST numbers between 65503-65532\nare randomly generated in conf-sanity test_81 and are expected to be\nvalid, so this subtest needs to be skipped for older clients.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=81,HONOR_EXCEPT=y clientversion=2.15\nFixes: 1a6ef725c2 (\"LU-16938 utils: setstripe overstripe multiple OST count\")\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I8b8125b98f3a62ba076ae5a4c2e32493c1c9c7e7\nReviewed-on: https://review.whamcloud.com/c/fs/lustre-release/+/65883\nReviewed-by: Arshad Hussain <arshad.hussain@aeoncomputing.com>\nReviewed-by: Rajeev Mishra <rajeevm@hpe.com>\nTested-by: jenkins <devops@whamcloud.com>\nReviewed-by: Oleg Drokin <green@whamcloud.com>\nTested-by: Maloo <maloo@whamcloud.com>\n"
      },
